        "pi_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the Ergonomic Sleeping Pillow and who is it for?",
            "content": "<p>The Ergonomic Sleeping Pillow is designed for people who want a consistent routine with practical benefits they can feel over time. It is best suited for customers looking for easy daily usage, clear directions, and messaging focused on realistic progress rather than hype. If you want a simple product you can use regularly and evaluate week by week, this is a strong fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "pi_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I use the Ergonomic Sleeping Pillow?",
            "content": "<p>Use it consistently according to the product instructions and keep your routine stable for the first few weeks. Most users get the best experience when they follow the same timing each day, avoid skipping days, and combine usage with healthy day-to-day habits. Consistency is more important than intensity, so a steady routine is recommended.</p>"
          }
        },
        "pi_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When should I expect results?",
            "content": "<p>Results are usually gradual, not instant. Early changes can appear in the first weeks, while stronger and more stable improvements typically come with longer consistent use. Individual timelines vary based on baseline habits, product fit, and consistency, so the best approach is to track progress over time instead of expecting immediate transformation.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
